FACTS = {
 'milvus': [
  ['Milvus 支持什么部署架构和硬件加速？','向量多了能横向扩展吗，CPU/GPU 都能加速吗？','Go/C++，CPU/GPU加速，distributed K8s-native架构，可横向扩展。',['Written in Go and C++, Milvus implements hardware acceleration for CPU/GPU','Thanks to its [fully-distributed and K8s-native architecture](https://milvus.io/docs/overview.md#What-Makes-Milvus-so-Scalable), Milvus can scale horizontally']],
  ['Milvus 在单机和 Python 快速试用有哪些版本？','不建分布式集群，单机或轻量试用怎么选？','Standalone单机，Milvus Lite轻量Python pip快速试用。',['Milvus also supports [Standalone mode](https://milvus.io/docs/install_standalone-docker.md) for single machine deployment. [Milvus Lite](https://milvus.io/docs/milvus_lite.md) is a lightweight version good for quickstart in python with `pip install`.']],
  ['Milvus Python SDK 如何安装，客户端类叫什么？','用 Python 接入，先安装什么，import 哪个类？','pip install -U pymilvus，from pymilvus import MilvusClient。',['$ pip install -U pymilvus','from pymilvus import MilvusClient']],
  ['Milvus Lite 怎样建立本地持久化数据库？','不连接远端，数据库写到本地文件怎么办？','安装 pymilvus[milvus-lite]，MilvusClient("milvus_demo.db")。',['* You can also try Milvus Lite for quickstart by installing `pymilvus[milvus-lite]`. To create a local vector database, simply instantiate a client with a local file name for persisting data:','client = MilvusClient("milvus_demo.db")']],
  ['连接远端 Milvus 或 Zilliz Cloud 的参数是什么？','服务器已经部署了，客户端地址和凭证传哪个字段？','MilvusClient uri 为endpoint，token 为用户密码或Cloud API key。',['client = MilvusClient(\n    uri="<endpoint_of_self_hosted_milvus_or_zilliz_cloud>",\n    token="<username_and_password_or_zilliz_cloud_api_key>")']],
  ['Milvus 示例集合名称和向量维数是什么？','create_collection 那个例子怎么指定名字和维度？','demo_collection，dimension=768。',['client.create_collection(\n    collection_name="demo_collection",\n    dimension=768,  # The vectors we will use in this demo have 768 dimensions\n)']],
  ['Milvus 示例怎样插入数据？','向那个 demo collection 写数据用什么调用？','client.insert(collection_name="demo_collection", data=data)。',['res = client.insert(collection_name="demo_collection", data=data)']],
  ['Milvus 查询示例支持批量吗，返回多少条和哪些字段？','多条 query vectors 能一起查吗，topK 和 output_fields 是什么？','data列表支持批量，limit=2，返回vector/text/subject。',['data=query_vectors,  # a list of one or more query vectors, supports batch\n    limit=2,  # how many results to return (topK)\n    output_fields=["vector", "text", "subject"],  # what fields to return']],
  ['Milvus 读多和写多时分别扩展哪些节点？','计算存储分离后，读取重和写入重该增加哪个节点？','读多增加query nodes，写多增加data node。',['achieving optimal performance by independently increasing query nodes for read-heavy workload and data node for write-heavy workload.']],
  ['Milvus 混合检索的全文和学习式稀疏表示是什么？','除了dense语义搜索，还有什么全文或稀疏模型支持？','原生全文BM25，学习稀疏SPLADE/BGE-M3，同集合存稀疏和稠密向量。',['Milvus also natively supports [full text search](https://milvus.io/docs/full-text-search.md) with BM25 as well as learned sparse embeddings such as SPLADE and BGE-M3. Users can store sparse vectors and dense vectors in the same collection']],
  ['Linux 编译 Milvus 对 CMake、GCC、Python 有什么要求？','Ubuntu 源码构建，具体工具版本范围是什么？','Ubuntu20.04+推荐，Go1.21+，CMake3.26.4+且<4，GCC11+，Python>3.8且<=3.11。',['* Linux systems (Ubuntu 20.04 or later recommended):\n  ```bash\n  Go: >= 1.21\n  CMake: >= 3.26.4 && CMake < 4\n  GCC: >= 11\n  Python: > 3.8 and  <= 3.11\n  ```']],
  ['Milvus 从 clone 到构建的基本顺序是什么？','拉下代码后，装依赖和编译分别执行什么？','git clone，cd milvus/，./scripts/install_deps.sh，make。',['$ git clone https://github.com/milvus-io/milvus.git','$ cd milvus/\n$ ./scripts/install_deps.sh','$ make']],
 ],
 'tidb': [
  ['TiDB 的 Ti 代表什么，数据库定位是什么？','TiDB 是哪种数据库，名字中的 Ti 有什么含义？','Titanium，开源云原生分布式SQL，HA、横纵扩展、强一致、高性能。',['TiDB (/’taɪdiːbi:/, "Ti" stands for Titanium) is an open-source, cloud-native, distributed SQL database designed for high availability, horizontal and vertical scalability, strong consistency, and high performance.']],
  ['TiDB 分布式事务通过什么协议保证 ACID？','跨多个节点的事务用什么提交方法？','two-phase commit，两阶段提交保证ACID和强一致。',['TiDB uses a two-phase commit protocol to ensure ACID compliance, providing strong consistency. Transactions span multiple nodes']],
  ['TiDB 横向与纵向扩展有何区别，会停机吗？','加机器和给旧机器加资源，都能在线完成吗？','横向加节点，纵向增加现有节点资源，无停机。',['TiDB can be scaled horizontally by adding more nodes or vertically by increasing resources of existing nodes, all without downtime.']],
  ['TiDB 的计算和存储可分别调整吗？','只想扩计算或只扩存储，架构允许吗？','计算存储分离，可独立调整。',["TiDB's architecture separates computing from storage, enabling you to adjust both independently as needed for flexibility and growth."]],
  ['TiDB 副本提交的条件和共识协议是什么？','数据要写到多少副本才提交，用哪个算法？','Raft，写多数副本后提交。',['Built-in Raft consensus protocol ensures reliability and automated failover. Data is stored in multiple replicas, and transactions are committed only after writing to the majority of replicas']],
  ['TiKV 与 TiFlash 的存储类型分别是什么？','做 HTAP 时，行存和列存分别由谁提供？','TiKV行存，TiFlash列存。',['TiDB provides two storage engines: TiKV, a row-based storage engine, and TiFlash, a columnar storage engine.']],
  ['TiFlash 怎样从 TiKV 同步数据，谁协调查询？','分析副本如何保持和事务数据一致，查询哪个组件调度？','Multi-Raft Learner实时复制，TiDB Server协调两引擎查询。',['TiFlash uses the Multi-Raft Learner protocol to replicate data from TiKV in real time, ensuring consistent data between the TiKV row-based storage engine and the TiFlash columnar storage engine. The TiDB Server coordinates query execution across both TiKV and TiFlash to optimize performance.']],
  ['Kubernetes 上哪个组件管理 TiDB，托管服务叫什么？','不手动管集群，有什么 Operator 或云服务？','TiDB Operator自动化K8s集群操作，TiDB Cloud fully-managed。',['[TiDB Operator](https://docs.pingcap.com/tidb-in-kubernetes/stable/tidb-operator-overview/?utm_source=github&utm_medium=tidb) helps manage TiDB on Kubernetes, automating cluster operations, while [TiDB Cloud](https://tidbcloud.com/?utm_source=github&utm_medium=tidb) provides a fully-managed service']],
  ['TiDB 兼容哪个 MySQL 版本，迁移应用是否要重写？','已有 MySQL 应用迁过去，协议工具和代码变化如何？','兼容MySQL8.0，可熟悉协议框架工具；无需或只需少量修改。',['TiDB is compatible with MySQL 8.0, allowing you to use familiar protocols, frameworks and tools. You can migrate applications to TiDB without changing any code, or with minimal modifications.']],
  ['TiDB README 推荐的免费起步方案是否要求信用卡？','想先开免费测试集群，推荐云方案需要绑卡吗？','TiDB Cloud推荐，free plan，no credit card required。',['TiDB Cloud offers a fully managed version of TiDB with a free plan, no credit card required']],
  ['与 TiDB 构建应用可用什么驱动或抽象？','连上数据库后，写业务时可以沿用什么客户端方式？','MySQL driver 或 ORM。',['3. Use a MySQL driver or an ORM to [Build an App with TiDB](https://docs.pingcap.com/tidbcloud/dev-guide-overview?utm_source=github&utm_medium=tidb).']],
  ['TiDB 故障排查文档入口是什么？','数据库出问题，首页提供哪份 troubleshooting 资料？','Troubleshooting documentation链接。',['- To troubleshoot TiDB, refer to [Troubleshooting documentation](https://docs.pingcap.com/tidb/stable/tidb-troubleshooting-map?utm_source=github&utm_medium=tidb).']],
 ],
 'airflow': [
  ['Airflow 更适合哪种变化频率的 workflow？','工作流结构每次都大变，还是基本稳定时更适合它？','主要静态、缓慢变化，Dag结构运行间相似。',['Airflow works best with workflows that are mostly static and slowly changing. When the Dag structure is similar from one run to the next, it clarifies the unit of work and continuity.']],
  ['Airflow 对任务幂等性有什么建议？','任务重跑能否造成目的端重复数据？','理想任务应幂等，结果相同且不产生重复目的数据。',['tasks should ideally be idempotent (i.e., results of the task will be the same, and will not create duplicated data in a destination system)']],
  ['Airflow 任务之间应传大量数据吗，XCom 用来传什么？','大文件直接从一个task交给下一个合适吗？','不应传大量数据，可XCom传元数据；大量密集工作委托专业外部服务。',["and should not pass large quantities of data from one task to the next (though tasks can pass metadata using Airflow's [XCom feature](https://airflow.apache.org/docs/apache-airflow/stable/concepts/xcoms.html)). For high-volume, data-intensive tasks, a best practice is to delegate to external services specializing in that type of work."]],
  ['Airflow 是流处理方案吗？','能把它当实时 streaming engine 直接持续处理流吗？','不是streaming solution，可按批从stream拉数据。',['Airflow is not a streaming solution, but it is often used to process real-time data, pulling data off streams in batches.']],
  ['Airflow 动态 DAG 与模板定制怎样实现？','流水线能动态生成吗，模板引擎是什么？','代码定义动态dag/参数化，Jinja模板定制。',['- **Dynamic**: Pipelines are defined in code, enabling dynamic dag generation and parameterization.','- **Flexible**: Airflow leverages the [**Jinja**](https://jinja.palletsprojects.com) templating engine, allowing rich customizations.']],
  ['Airflow 推荐 MariaDB 吗？','已有 MariaDB，首页说它受测试和推荐吗？','MariaDB不受测试或推荐。',['**Note**: MariaDB is not tested/recommended.']],
  ['Airflow SQLite 可用于生产吗，本地推荐什么？','演示用 SQLite，正式上线也能沿用吗？','测试用，不要生产用；本地推荐SQLite最新稳定版。',['**Note**: SQLite is used in Airflow tests. Do not use it in production. We recommend\nusing the latest stable version of SQLite for local development.']],
  ['Windows 开发 Airflow 有什么方式，生产环境要求什么？','直接原生 Windows 运行受支持吗，生产能用哪个系统？','Windows用WSL2或Linux Containers；生产仅支持Linux distros。',['On Windows you can run it via WSL2 (Windows Subsystem for Linux 2) or via Linux Containers.','You should only use Linux-based distros as "Production" execution environment\nas this is the only environment that is supported.']],
  ['为什么直接 pip install apache-airflow 可能失败或不可用？','不锁约束直接装包，README 指出什么问题？','依赖尽量开放，简单pipinstall可能失败或产生不可用安装。',['We decided to keep\nour dependencies as open as possible (in `pyproject.toml`) so users can install different versions of libraries\nif needed. This means that `pip install apache-airflow` will not work from time to time or will\nproduce unusable Airflow installation.']],
  ['Airflow 可复现安装的 constraints URL 要匹配哪些版本？','约束文件能随便选吗，要和哪些版本对上？','按Python major/minor分开，URL指定正确Airflow tag/version/branch及Python版本。',['constraints files separately per major/minor Python version.\nYou can use them as constraint files when installing Airflow from PyPI. Note that you have to specify\ncorrect Airflow tag/version/branch and Python versions in the URL.']],
  ['哪些安装工具受 Airflow 官方支持，Poetry 怎样处理？','能用 Poetry 或 pip-tools 按官方工作流安装吗？','目前仅pip、uv官方支持；Poetry/pip-tools不支持，需转换constraints格式工作流。',['> Note: Only `pip` and `uv` installation is currently officially supported.','Installing via `Poetry` or `pip-tools` is not currently supported.','If you wish to install Airflow using those tools, you should use the constraint files and convert\nthem to the appropriate format and workflow that your tool requires.']],
  ['Airflow 正式源码发行与 PyPI/Docker 便利包有什么区别？','PyPI包和镜像都算ASF正式release吗，正式源码怎样签名？','正式源码由release manager签名；便利包不是ASF定义正式release，用正式源码准备。',['- Are cryptographically signed by the release manager','All those artifacts are not official releases, but they are prepared using officially released sources.']],
 ],
 'pytorch': [
  ['torch、torch.autograd、torch.nn 分别负责什么？','张量、自动求导和神经网络在它里面怎么分工？','torch 张量库，autograd tape-based 自动微分，nn 神经网络并深度集成 autograd。',['A Tensor library like NumPy, with strong GPU support','A tape-based automatic differentiation library that supports all differentiable Tensor operations in torch','A neural networks library deeply integrated with autograd designed for maximum flexibility']],
  ['torch.multiprocessing 与普通 multiprocessing 有什么特点？','跨进程加载数据，PyTorch 怎么处理 Tensor 内存？','跨进程共享 torch Tensor 内存，适合数据加载与 Hogwild。',['Python multiprocessing, but with magical memory sharing of torch Tensors across processes. Useful for data loading and Hogwild training']],
  ['PyTorch Tensor 可以放在哪些设备？','张量必须在显卡上吗，也能放 CPU 吗？','CPU 或 GPU。',['PyTorch provides Tensors that can live either on the CPU or the GPU and accelerates the\ncomputation by a huge amount.']],
  ['PyTorch 使用什么自动微分方式，网络行为能动态变化吗？','前向逻辑变化是否必须重新固定整个网络结构？','reverse-mode auto-differentiation，支持动态变化网络行为。',['With PyTorch, we use a technique called reverse-mode auto-differentiation, which allows you to\nchange the way your network behaves arbitrarily with zero lag or overhead.']],
  ['PyTorch 自定义 C/C++ 层是否需要手写 wrapper？','想用 C++ 扩展自己的层，有什么接口，包装代码要自己写吗？','提供便捷 extension API，无需 wrapper code。',['If you want to write your layers in C/C++, we provide a convenient extension API that is efficient and with minimal boilerplate.\nNo wrapper code needs to be written.']],
  ['源码构建 PyTorch 的 Python、编译器、磁盘条件是什么？','从零编译该准备哪些版本，至少留多少空间？','Python3.10+，完整 C++20 编译器；Linux gcc11.3+；Windows VS工具；至少10GB；首次30–60分钟。',['- Python 3.10 or later\n- A compiler that fully supports C++20, such as clang or gcc (gcc 11.3.0 or newer is required, on Linux)\n- Visual Studio or Visual Studio Build Tool (Windows only)\n- At least 10 GB of free disk space\n- 30-60 minutes for the initial build (subsequent rebuilds are much faster)']],
  ['Visual Studio Code 是否默认包含 PyTorch 需要的构建工具？','已经装 VS Code，Windows 编译工具就齐了吗？','不包含，需要 Visual C++ BuildTools 或对应 VS版本。',['The build tools *do not*\ncome with Visual Studio Code by default.']],
  ['PyTorch 源码构建必须使用 Conda 环境吗？','我只有 uv 虚拟环境，不用 Conda 能编译吗？','不必须，可标准虚拟环境如 uv，但系统要装 CUDA/MKL 等非 pip 依赖。',['A conda environment is not required.  You can also do a PyTorch build in a\nstandard virtual environment, e.g., created with tools like `uv`, provided\nyour system has installed all the necessary dependencies unavailable as pip\npackages (e.g., CUDA, MKL.)']],
  ['CUDA 构建需要哪些额外依赖？','想让编译后的 PyTorch 用 NVIDIA GPU，要装什么？','受支持 CUDA，cuDNN9.0+，与 CUDA 兼容的编译器。',['- [NVIDIA CUDA](https://developer.nvidia.com/cuda-downloads)\n- [NVIDIA cuDNN](https://developer.nvidia.com/cudnn) v9.0 or above\n- [Compiler](https://gist.github.com/ax3l/9489132) compatible with CUDA']],
  ['ROCm 构建的平台和自定义路径要求是什么？','AMD 环境只支持哪些系统，没装 /opt/rocm 怎么指定？','ROCm4.0+，仅 Linux；不同目录设 ROCM_PATH。',['- [AMD ROCm](https://rocm.docs.amd.com/en/latest/deploy/linux/quick_start.html) 4.0 and above installation\n- ROCm is currently supported only for Linux systems.','By default the build system expects ROCm to be installed in `/opt/rocm`. If ROCm is installed in a different directory, the `ROCM_PATH` environment variable must be set to the ROCm installation directory.']],
  ['PyTorch 如何在构建时关闭 CUDA、ROCm、Intel GPU？','只想编 CPU 版，这三种 GPU 支持分别怎么关？','USE_CUDA=0、USE_ROCM=0、USE_XPU=0。',['If you want to disable CUDA support, export the environment variable `USE_CUDA=0`.','If you want to disable ROCm support, export the environment variable `USE_ROCM=0`.','If you want to disable Intel GPU support, export the environment variable `USE_XPU=0`.']],
  ['更新已有 PyTorch checkout 后如何同步子模块？','已经拉过仓库，再更新时子模块应该执行哪两步？','git submodule sync，git submodule update --init --recursive。',['# if you are updating an existing checkout\ngit submodule sync\ngit submodule update --init --recursive']],
 ],
 'tensorflow': [
  ['TensorFlow 哪些语言 API 稳定，其他语言怎样承诺兼容性？','Python 和 C++ 接口稳定吗，其他语言也保证向后兼容吗？','Python、C++ 稳定；其他语言 API 不保证向后兼容。',['TensorFlow provides stable [Python](https://www.tensorflow.org/api_docs/python)\nand [C++](https://www.tensorflow.org/api_docs/cc) APIs, as well as a\nnon-guaranteed backward compatible API for\n[other languages](https://www.tensorflow.org/api_docs).']],
  ['TensorFlow 当前发行版如何通过 pip 安装？','初次安装正常版，包名是什么？','pip install tensorflow。',[' pip install tensorflow\n']],
  ['CPU-only TensorFlow 包如何安装？','没有 GPU，想装小一些的 CPU 版怎么敲？','pip install tensorflow-cpu。',['A smaller CPU-only TensorFlow package is also available:',' pip install tensorflow-cpu']],
  ['TensorFlow 如何升级到最新版本？','之前已经装了，pip 命令要加什么参数更新？','在安装命令加 --upgrade。',['To update TensorFlow to the latest version, add the `--upgrade` flag to the\ncommands above.']],
  ['TensorFlow nightly 测试包有哪些？','想试最新每夜构建，普通和 CPU 包叫什么？','tf-nightly 和 tf-nightly-cpu。',['[tf-nightly](https://pypi.python.org/pypi/tf-nightly) and\n[tf-nightly-cpu](https://pypi.python.org/pypi/tf-nightly-cpu) packages on PyPI.']],
  ['DirectX 和 MacOS-metal 的 TensorFlow 支持通过什么提供？','不是 CUDA 的这两类设备，首页说怎样支持？','Device Plugins。',['Other devices (DirectX and MacOS-metal) are supported using\n[Device Plugins](https://www.tensorflow.org/install/gpu_plugins#available_devices).']],
  ['第一个 TensorFlow 加法程序如何验证安装？','装好后想算 1+2，调用什么，返回多少？','import tensorflow as tf；tf.add(1,2).numpy() 返回3。',['>>> import tensorflow as tf\n>>> tf.add(1, 2).numpy()\n3']],
  ['TensorFlow 字符串常量示例返回什么？','Hello 常量转 numpy 后是什么结果？','tf.constant，hello.numpy() 得到字节串 b\'Hello, TensorFlow!\'。',[">>> hello = tf.constant('Hello, TensorFlow!')\n>>> hello.numpy()\nb'Hello, TensorFlow!'"]],
  ['参与 TensorFlow 贡献前需要遵循什么？','提交贡献前应读哪些指南和参与规则？','Contribution Guidelines、Code of Conduct。',["**If you want to contribute to TensorFlow, be sure to review the\n[Contribution Guidelines](CONTRIBUTING.md). This project adheres to TensorFlow's\n[Code of Conduct](CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md). By participating, you are expected to\nuphold this code.**"]],
  ['TensorFlow bug、一般讨论、具体问题分别在哪？','提缺陷、聊天和问具体技术题，要去哪些平台？','GitHub Issues 跟踪请求和bugs；Forum一般讨论；Stack Overflow具体问题。',['**We use [GitHub Issues](https://github.com/tensorflow/tensorflow/issues) for\ntracking requests and bugs, please see\n[TensorFlow Forum](https://discuss.tensorflow.org/) for general questions and\ndiscussion, and please direct specific questions to\n[Stack Overflow](https://stackoverflow.com/questions/tagged/tensorflow).**']],
  ['为指定 TensorFlow 版本打补丁的顺序是什么？','要回补安全修复到某个版本，不能只 cherry-pick 就结束吧？','切对应分支、应用变化解决冲突、通过测试、从源码构建pip包。',['*   Clone the TensorFlow repository and switch to the appropriate branch for\n    your desired version—for example, `r2.8` for version 2.8.\n*   Apply the desired changes (i.e., cherry-pick them) and resolve any code\n    conflicts.\n*   Run TensorFlow tests and ensure they pass.\n*   [Build](https://www.tensorflow.org/install/source) the TensorFlow pip\n    package from source.']],
  ['TensorFlow 发布和安全更新公告在哪订阅？','想及时获知版本和安全消息，README 给什么订阅入口？','announce@tensorflow.org。',['Keep up-to-date with release announcements and security updates by subscribing\nto\n[announce@tensorflow.org](https://groups.google.com/a/tensorflow.org/forum/#!forum/announce).']],
 ],
 'supabase': [
  ['Supabase 是否与 Firebase 一对一完全映射？','能把它理解成完全相同的开源 Firebase 吗？','不是一对一映射，目标是用开源工具提供类似开发体验。',["Supabase is not a 1-to-1 mapping of Firebase. Our aim is to give developers a Firebase-like developer experience using open source tools."]],
  ['Supabase 支持托管、自托管和本地开发吗？','一定要自己安装服务器吗，能用云平台或本地开发吗？','托管可免安装注册使用；也可 self-host 与 develop locally。',['Supabase is a [hosted platform](https://supabase.com/dashboard). You can sign up and start using Supabase without installing anything.\nYou can also [self-host](https://supabase.com/docs/guides/hosting/overview) and [develop locally](https://supabase.com/docs/guides/local-development).']],
  ['Supabase Realtime 如何传递数据库变化？','数据库新增、修改、删除，浏览器怎么实时收到？','Elixir server 监听 PostgreSQL变化，轮询内置replication，转JSON，以websockets广播给授权客户端。',["- [Realtime](https://github.com/supabase/realtime) is an Elixir server that allows you to listen to PostgreSQL inserts, updates, and deletes using websockets. Realtime polls Postgres' built-in replication functionality for database changes, converts changes to JSON, then broadcasts the JSON over websockets to authorized clients."]],
  ['Supabase 哪个组件把 PostgreSQL 变成 REST API？','不手写接口，哪个服务直接把数据库暴露成 REST？','PostgREST。',['- [PostgREST](http://postgrest.org/) is a web server that turns your PostgreSQL database directly into a RESTful API.']],
  ['Supabase 的注册、登录与 session 由什么组件负责？','身份认证底层使用什么，基于哪个令牌机制？','GoTrue，JWT-based authentication API。',['- [GoTrue](https://github.com/supabase/gotrue) is a JWT-based authentication API that simplifies user sign-ups, logins, and session management in your applications.']],
  ['Supabase Storage 文件和权限分别由什么处理？','文件放哪里，访问权限由数据库还是存储服务管理？','RESTful API 管理 S3 文件，Postgres 管理权限。',['- [Storage](https://github.com/supabase/storage-api) a RESTful API for managing files in S3, with Postgres handling permissions.']],
  ['Supabase 通过哪个 PostgreSQL 扩展提供 GraphQL？','除了 REST，哪个扩展可暴露 GraphQL API？','pg_graphql。',['- [pg_graphql](http://github.com/supabase/pg_graphql/) a PostgreSQL extension that exposes a GraphQL API.']],
  ['Supabase postgres-meta 有什么管理能力？','要获取表、加角色和运行查询，用哪个 REST 管理服务？','postgres-meta 管理 Postgres，获取表、加角色、运行查询等。',['- [postgres-meta](https://github.com/supabase/postgres-meta) is a RESTful API for managing your Postgres, allowing you to fetch tables, add roles, and run queries, etc.']],
  ['Supabase 架构里的 Envoy 是什么？','README 中 Envoy 负责哪类代理功能？','云原生高性能 edge and service proxy。',['- [Envoy](https://github.com/envoyproxy/envoy) is a cloud-native, high-performance edge and service proxy.']],
  ['Supabase client libraries 的模块组织原则是什么？','客户端是全都绑一起还是每个外部系统独立实现？','模块化，每个子库独立实现单个外部系统，支持已有工具。',['Our approach for client libraries is modular. Each sub-library is a standalone implementation for a single external system. This is one of the ways we support existing tools.']],
  ['Supabase 使用帮助与 bug 应分别走什么入口？','开发过程中需要帮助和发现错误，README 怎样区分渠道？','Community Forum帮助开发和数据库实践，GitHub Issues报bugs/errors。',['- [Community Forum](https://github.com/supabase/supabase/discussions). Best for: help with building, discussion about database best practices.','- [GitHub Issues](https://github.com/supabase/supabase/issues). Best for: bugs and errors you encounter using Supabase.']],
  ['Supabase 数据库基础设施问题与分享应用分别去哪？','数据库出问题想找支持，或者展示作品，分别去哪？','Email Support处理数据库基础设施问题，Discord分享应用和社区交流。',['- [Email Support](https://supabase.com/docs/support#business-support). Best for: problems with your database or infrastructure.','- [Discord](https://discord.supabase.com). Best for: sharing your applications and hanging out with the community.']],
 ],
 'grafana': [
  ['Grafana 对指标数据提供哪些基本能力？','数据在别处存着，也能查询、画图、报警吗？','查询、可视化、告警、理解指标，创建探索共享 dashboard。',['Grafana allows you to query, visualize, alert on and understand your metrics no matter where they are stored.']],
  ['Grafana panel plugins 可展示什么？','除了普通折线图，还有扩展面板画指标和日志吗？','panel plugins 提供多种指标、日志可视化。',['Panel plugins offer many different ways to visualize metrics and logs.']],
  ['Grafana 动态 dashboard 的模板变量怎样显示？','怎样做能复用的看板，让用户下拉选择变量？','template variables 在顶部显示为下拉列表。',['- **Dynamic Dashboards:** Create dynamic & reusable dashboards with template variables that appear as dropdowns at the top of the dashboard.']],
  ['Grafana Explore Metrics 如何比较数据？','想并排比较不同时间、查询和数据源，有什么能力？','ad-hoc 查询、动态钻取，split view 并排比较。',['- **Explore Metrics:** Explore your data through ad-hoc queries and dynamic drilldown. Split view and compare different time ranges, queries and data sources side by side.']],
  ['Grafana 从指标切到日志时会保留什么？','查完指标再查日志，标签筛选还在吗，能看实时流吗？','保留 label filters，可快速搜索日志或实时流式查看。',['- **Explore Logs:** Experience the magic of switching from metrics to logs with preserved label filters. Quickly search through all your logs or streaming them live.']],
  ['Grafana 如何定义告警，通知哪些系统？','规则能图形化配置并自动持续判断吗？','可视化定义规则，持续评估，通知 Slack/PagerDuty/VictorOps/OpsGenie。',['- **Alerting:** Visually define alert rules for your most important metrics. Grafana will continuously evaluate and send notifications to systems like Slack, PagerDuty, VictorOps, OpsGenie.']],
  ['Grafana 单张图能混合不同数据源吗？','每条查询使用不同来源，甚至自定义源，行不行？','可在同一图按 query 指定数据源，也支持自定义源。',['- **Mixed Data Sources:** Mix different data sources in the same graph! You can specify a data source on a per-query basis. This works for even custom datasources.']],
  ['Grafana 在哪可以先体验演示？','不安装先看它工作，有什么 demo 地址？','play.grafana.org。',['Unsure if Grafana is for you? Watch Grafana in action on [play.grafana.org](https://play.grafana.org/)!']],
  ['Grafana 贡献前和本地开发应分别读什么？','想参与项目，贡献流程与环境配置入口在哪？','Contributing guide，Developer guide。',['- Start by reading the [Contributing guide](https://github.com/grafana/grafana/blob/HEAD/CONTRIBUTING.md).','- Learn how to set up your local environment, in our [Developer guide](https://github.com/grafana/grafana/blob/HEAD/contribute/developer-guide.md).']],
  ['Grafana 新手任务通过哪个标签查找？','刚开始参与，README 给了什么新手 issue 入口？','beginner friendly 标签的开放 issue。',['- Explore our [beginner-friendly issues](https://github.com/grafana/grafana/issues?q=is%3Aopen+is%3Aissue+label%3A%22beginner+friendly%22).']],
  ['Grafana 具体问题与一般讨论各去哪里？','有问题问论坛，还是加入 Slack，README 怎么分？','具体问题 discussion forums，一般讨论 official Slack。',['- If you have a specific question, check out our [discussion forums](https://community.grafana.com/).','- For general discussions, join us on the [official Slack](https://slack.grafana.com) team.']],
  ['Grafana 默认许可和例外说明是什么？','它整体是什么开源协议，Apache 例外在哪里看？','AGPL-3.0-only，Apache-2.0 例外见 LICENSING.md。',['Grafana is distributed under [AGPL-3.0-only](LICENSE). For Apache-2.0 exceptions, see [LICENSING.md](https://github.com/grafana/grafana/blob/HEAD/LICENSING.md).']],
 ],
 'opensearch': [
  ['OpenSearch 面向什么数据和功能？','大量非结构化数据，能做什么搜索和观测？','开源搜索与 observability suite，处理大规模非结构化数据。',['OpenSearch is an open-source, enterprise-grade search and observability suite that brings order to unstructured data at scale.']],
  ['OpenSearch 的下载入口在哪？','想获取安装包，首页给了什么链接？','opensearch.org/downloads/。',['* [Downloads](https://opensearch.org/downloads/)']],
  ['OpenSearch 完整文档在哪里？','首页没展开配置，完整资料地址是什么？','docs.opensearch.org。',['* [Documentation](https://docs.opensearch.org/)']],
  ['OpenSearch 用户支持渠道有哪些？','需要使用帮助，README 提到论坛和什么渠道？','Forums 和 Slack。',['* Need help? Try [Forums](https://discuss.opendistrocommunity.dev/) or [Slack](https://opensearch.org/slack/)']],
  ['OpenSearch 贡献指引在哪个文件？','准备参与开发，该先读哪个本地指南？','CONTRIBUTING.md。',['* [Contributing to OpenSearch](CONTRIBUTING.md)']],
  ['OpenSearch 维护者和管理员职责在哪查看？','maintainer 和 admin 的规范分别在哪？','MAINTAINERS.md、ADMINS.md。',['* [Maintainer Responsibilities](MAINTAINERS.md)','* [Admin Responsibilities](ADMINS.md)']],
  ['OpenSearch 的发布管理和测试资料在哪？','想查发布流程与测试要求，应看哪两个文件？','RELEASING.md、TESTING.md。',['* [Release Management](RELEASING.md)','* [Testing](TESTING.md)']],
  ['对 OpenSearch 行为准则有疑问应联系哪里？','社区参与规则不清楚，README 提供什么联系地址？','conduct@opensearch.foundation。',['Please contact [conduct@opensearch.foundation](mailto:conduct@opensearch.foundation) with any additional questions or comments.']],
  ['发现 OpenSearch 安全问题怎样报告，能公开提 issue 吗？','怀疑有漏洞，是发公开 GitHub issue 还是私下联系？','邮件 security@opensearch.org；不要公开创建 GitHub issue。',['If you discover a potential security issue in this project we ask that you notify OpenSearch Security directly via email to security@opensearch.org. Please do **not** create a public GitHub issue.']],
  ['OpenSearch 使用什么许可？','这个项目按什么开源协议分发？','Apache v2.0 License，LICENSE.txt。',['This project is licensed under the [Apache v2.0 License](LICENSE.txt).']],
  ['OpenSearch 的版权归属和详细声明在哪？','版权标给谁，NOTICE 是哪个文件？','OpenSearch Contributors；NOTICE.txt。',['Copyright OpenSearch Contributors. See [NOTICE](NOTICE.txt) for details.']],
  ['OpenSearch 商标归谁所有？','OpenSearch 注册商标属于哪家公司或组织？','LF Projects, LLC。',['OpenSearch is a registered trademark of LF Projects, LLC.']],
 ],
 'argocd': [
  ['Argo CD 是什么类型的工具，目标平台是什么？','这工具负责 Kubernetes 的什么交付方式？','Kubernetes 的声明式 GitOps continuous delivery 工具。',['Argo CD is a declarative GitOps continuous delivery tool for Kubernetes.']],
  ['Argo CD 对应用定义、配置和环境提出什么原则？','应用配置应该手改，还是声明并纳入版本管理？','应该声明式且版本控制。',['1. Application definitions, configurations, and environments should be declarative and version controlled.']],
  ['Argo CD 希望部署和生命周期管理具备什么特点？','发布过程应该怎么管，能追溯吗？','自动化、可审计、易理解。',['1. Application deployment and lifecycle management should be automated, auditable, and easy to understand.']],
  ['Argo CD 正式用户列表在哪个文件？','想看有哪些用户用了它，README 指向哪里？','USERS.md。',['[Official Argo CD user list](USERS.md)']],
  ['Argo CD 的完整文档和在线 demo 分别在哪？','详细资料去哪读，想在线体验又去哪个地址？','argo-cd.readthedocs.io，cd.apps.argoproj.io。',['To learn more about Argo CD [go to the complete documentation](https://argo-cd.readthedocs.io/).','Check live demo at https://cd.apps.argoproj.io/.']],
  ['Argo CD 的问答渠道是什么？','遇到疑问想正式讨论，用哪个 GitHub 功能？','GitHub Discussions。',['* Q & A : [GitHub Discussions](https://github.com/argoproj/argo-cd/discussions)']],
  ['Argo CD 即时聊天频道是什么？','要和开发者实时聊，Slack 的什么频道？','The #argo-cd Slack channel。',['* Chat : [The #argo-cd Slack channel](https://argoproj.github.io/community/join-slack)']],
  ['Argo CD 贡献者办公时间是什么频率？','想参加 Contributors Office Hours，哪天举办？','Every Thursday。',['* Contributors Office Hours: [Every Thursday](https://calendar.google.com/calendar/u/0/embed?src=argoproj@gmail.com)']],
  ['Argo CD 用户社区会议什么时候？','用户交流会每个月哪一天？','每月第一个星期三。',['* User Community meeting: [First Wednesday of the month](https://calendar.google.com/calendar/u/0/embed?src=argoproj@gmail.com)']],
  ['参与 Argo CD 项目遵循什么行为准则？','加入社区要按哪个基金会的 Code of Conduct？','CNCF Code of Conduct。',['Participation in the Argo CD project is governed by the [CNCF Code of Conduct](https://github.com/cncf/foundation/blob/master/code-of-conduct.md)']],
  ['Argo 相关项目和资源合集入口是什么？','有没有整理好的 Awesome 列表可继续学习？','Awesome-Argo Curated List。',['1. [Awesome-Argo: A Curated List of Awesome Projects and Resources Related to Argo](https://github.com/terrytangyuan/awesome-argo)']],
  ['README 列出多长的 GitOps Ninja 教程？','想看那个 GitOps 和 Argo CD 系统教程，时长是多少？','90 分钟；README 只给视频链接，不包含教程内容。',['1. [Tutorial: Everything You Need To Become A GitOps Ninja](https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=r50tRQjisxw) 90m tutorial on GitOps and Argo CD.']],
 ],
 'prometheus': [
  ['Prometheus 数据模型如何定义时间序列？','一条时序除了指标名，还用什么维度区分？','metric name 和 key/value dimensions。',['* A **multi-dimensional** data model (time series defined by metric name and set of key/value dimensions)']],
  ['Prometheus 主要拉取还是推送指标，批任务怎样推送？','正常采集是 pull 吗，短批任务能 push 吗？','HTTP pull；batch jobs 可经 intermediary gateway 推送。',['* An HTTP **pull model** for time series collection','* **Pushing time series** is supported via an intermediary gateway for batch jobs']],
  ['Prometheus 单节点依赖分布式存储吗？','只起一个服务，还必须配外部分布式存储吗？','不依赖分布式存储，single server nodes autonomous。',['* No dependency on distributed storage; **single server nodes are autonomous**']],
  ['Prometheus 怎样发现采集目标？','监控目标得一个个手填吗，能自动发现吗？','service discovery 或 static configuration。',['* Targets are discovered via **service discovery** or **static configuration**']],
  ['README 推荐哪种 Prometheus 安装方式？','想稳妥安装，首页建议源码还是发行二进制？','推荐最新 production release binary。',['on [prometheus.io](https://prometheus.io). Using the latest production release binary\nis the recommended way to install Prometheus.']],
  ['本地 Prometheus 容器示例如何绑定端口？','只让本机访问 9090，README 示例命令是什么？','docker run --name prometheus -d -p 127.0.0.1:9090:9090 prom/prometheus。',['docker run --name prometheus -d -p 127.0.0.1:9090:9090 prom/prometheus']],
  ['构建 Prometheus 需要哪些工具和版本要求？','Go、Node 和 npm 应按什么版本准备？','Go 按 go.mod 或更高，Node 按 .nvmrc 或更高，npm10+。',['* Go: Version specified in [go.mod](./go.mod) or greater.\n* NodeJS: Version specified in [.nvmrc](./web/ui/.nvmrc) or greater.\n* npm: Version 10 or greater']],
  ['怎样用 go install 构建并启动指定配置？','用 Go 工具安装后，配置文件参数怎么传？','go install .../cmd/...，prometheus --config.file=your_config.yml。',['go install github.com/prometheus/prometheus/cmd/...\nprometheus --config.file=your_config.yml']],
  ['go install 构建后为什么需要在仓库根目录启动？','编译成功却找不到 web 资源，README 说明什么限制？','从本地 web/ui/static 读资源，需根目录启动；React UI 需 make assets 或 make build。',['*However*, when using `go install` to build Prometheus, Prometheus will expect to be able to\nread its web assets from local filesystem directories under `web/ui/static`. In order for\nthese assets to be found, you will have to run Prometheus from the root of the cloned\nrepository. Note also that this directory does not include the React UI unless it has been\nbuilt explicitly using `make assets` or `make build`.']],
  ['怎样构建可从任意目录启动的 Prometheus？','想把 web 资源打进二进制，不受工作目录限制怎么办？','make build 编译进 web assets。',['You can also build using `make build`, which will compile in the web assets so that\nPrometheus can be run from anywhere:','make build\n./prometheus --config.file=your_config.yml']],
  ['Prometheus Makefile 的 test、test-short 和 assets 做什么？','普通测试、短测试、React 页面分别用哪些目标？','test 跑测试，test-short 短测试，assets 构建 React UI。',['* *test*: run the tests\n* *test-short*: run the short tests','* *assets*: build the React UI']],
  ['怎样去掉可选服务发现，只保留 Kubernetes 插件？','想缩减构建里的 SD 插件，build tags 该如何设置？','remove_all_sd 后 enable_kubernetes_sd；file/static/http 不在可选删除中。',['go build -tags "remove_all_sd,enable_kubernetes_sd" ./cmd/prometheus','* `remove_all_sd` - Exclude all optional service discoveries (keeps file_sd, static_sd, and http_sd)']],
 ],
 'duckdb': [
  ['DuckDB 主要是什么数据库？','它适合做事务还是分析，首页怎样定位？','高性能分析数据库，追求快速、可靠、可移植、易用。',['DuckDB is a high-performance analytical database system. It is designed to be fast, reliable, portable, and easy to use.']],
  ['DuckDB 支持哪些复杂 SQL 能力？','相关子查询、窗口函数和复杂类型都支持吗？','任意及嵌套相关子查询、窗口函数、collations、arrays/structs/maps。',['DuckDB supports arbitrary and nested correlated subqueries, window functions, collations, complex types (arrays, structs, maps)']],
  ['DuckDB 有哪些客户端形式？','除了终端，Python、Java 和浏览器能用吗？','独立 CLI 及 Python、R、Java、Wasm 等客户端。',['DuckDB is available as a [standalone CLI application](https://duckdb.org/docs/current/clients/cli/overview) and has clients for [Python](https://duckdb.org/docs/current/clients/python/overview), [R](https://duckdb.org/docs/current/clients/r), [Java](https://duckdb.org/docs/current/clients/java), [Wasm](https://duckdb.org/docs/current/clients/wasm/overview), etc.']],
  ['DuckDB 与哪些数据分析包深度集成？','已经用 pandas 或 dplyr，README 提到能集成吗？','pandas 和 dplyr。',['with deep integrations with packages such as [pandas](https://duckdb.org/docs/guides/python/sql_on_pandas) and [dplyr](https://duckdb.org/docs/current/clients/r#duckplyr-dplyr-api).']],
  ['查询 CSV 文件的示例 SQL 是什么？','不先建表，怎么直接读取 myfile.csv？','SELECT * FROM \'myfile.csv\';，FROM 引用文件。',['For CSV files and Parquet files, data import is as simple as referencing the file in the FROM clause:',"SELECT * FROM 'myfile.csv';"]],
  ['查询 Parquet 文件的示例 SQL 是什么？','myfile.parquet 能直接查吗，怎么写？','SELECT * FROM \'myfile.parquet\';。',["SELECT * FROM 'myfile.parquet';"]],
  ['开发 DuckDB 需要哪些工具和语言标准？','想从源码编译，要先装什么版本的工具？','CMake、Python 3、兼容 C++17 的编译器。',['For development, DuckDB requires [CMake](https://cmake.org), Python 3 and a `C++17` compliant compiler.']],
  ['源码普通构建与调试构建命令是什么？','正常编译和不优化的 debug 版分别怎么构建？','根目录 make，调试版 make debug。',['In the root directory, run `make` to compile the sources. For development, use `make debug` to build a non-optimized debug version.']],
  ['修改 DuckDB 后应运行哪些单元验证命令？','改了代码，README 要求用什么命令确认没问题？','make unit 和 make allunit。',['You should run `make unit` and `make allunit` to verify that your version works properly after making changes.']],
  ['DuckDB 性能测试如何构建和执行？','想跑它的标准 benchmark，需要开什么构建开关？','BUILD_BENCHMARK=1 BUILD_TPCH=1 make，根目录执行 benchmark_runner。',['To test performance, you can run `BUILD_BENCHMARK=1 BUILD_TPCH=1 make` and then perform several standard benchmarks from the root directory by executing `./build/release/benchmark/benchmark_runner`.']],
  ['DuckDB 安装详细步骤在哪查看？','README 没列安装命令，它指向哪里？','installation page。',['If you want to install DuckDB, please see [our installation page](https://duckdb.org/docs/installation/) for instructions.']],
  ['DuckDB 的支持与生命周期信息入口是什么？','需要支持服务或查版本停止维护时间，该点哪里？','Support Options 和 endoflife.date 专页。',['See the [Support Options](https://ducklabs.com/support/) page and the dedicated [`endoflife.date`](https://endoflife.date/duckdb) page.']],
 ],
 'qdrant': [
  ['Qdrant 的 point 包含哪些内容？','它存的是纯向量，还是能附带业务数据？','vector 加额外 payload，API 可存储、搜索、管理。',['It provides a production-ready service with a convenient API to store, search, and manage points—vectors with an additional payload.']],
  ['Qdrant 使用什么语言开发？','这个高负载向量引擎主要用什么语言写？','Rust。',['Qdrant is written in Rust 🦀, which makes it fast and reliable even under high load.']],
  ['本地启动 Qdrant 的 Docker 命令是什么？','想先起个容器试试，应该映射哪个端口？','docker run -p 6333:6333 qdrant/qdrant。',['docker run -p 6333:6333 qdrant/qdrant']],
  ['README 的简单 Docker 启动命令有什么安全注意事项？','首页这个容器直接放生产安全吗，有没有认证？','无认证，开放所有网络接口，不安全；应参考 secure your instance。',['Note that this starts an insecure deployment without authentication, open to all network interfaces. Please refer to [secure your instance](https://qdrant.tech/documentation/security/#secure-your-instance).']],
  ['Python 示例怎样连接本地 Qdrant？','容器起来后，Python client 要用哪个地址？','QdrantClient(url="http://localhost:6333")。',['from qdrant_client import QdrantClient\n\nclient = QdrantClient(url="http://localhost:6333")']],
  ['生产部署前必须阅读哪两份指南？','从试用切到线上前，README 提醒看什么？','installation 与 security guides。',['Before deploying Qdrant to production, be sure to read our [installation](https://qdrant.tech/documentation/installation/) and [security](https://qdrant.tech/documentation/security/) guides.']],
  ['Qdrant Edge 和 Server 的运行方式有何区别？','离线边缘设备是否必须连独立服务器？','Edge 在应用进程内运行，数据本地存储查询，可与 Server 同步。',['Unlike Qdrant Server, which uses a client-server architecture, Qdrant Edge runs inside the application process. Data is stored and queried locally and can be synchronized with a Qdrant server.']],
  ['Qdrant REST 接口使用什么规范？','能根据 API 描述自动生成客户端吗？','OpenAPI 3.0 specification，可生成多数语言和框架客户端。',['Qdrant provides a REST API with an [OpenAPI 3.0 specification](https://api.qdrant.tech/), enabling client generation for virtually any framework or programming language.']],
  ['Qdrant 稠密、稀疏和多向量各用于什么？','语义搜索、全文搜索和 ColBERT 分别属于哪种向量支持？','dense 语义，sparse 全文，multivector 多嵌入或 ColBERT 晚交互。',['Qdrant supports dense vectors for semantic similarity, sparse vectors for full-text search, and multivector search for objects with multiple embeddings or late interaction models like ColBERT.']],
  ['payload 过滤有哪些条件和布尔组合？','向量带 JSON 业务字段，怎么限制搜索范围？','关键词、全文、数值范围、地理位置等，结合 should/must/must_not。',['Attach any JSON payload to your vectors and filter on it using a rich set of conditions—keyword matching, full-text, numeric ranges, geo-locations, and more—combined with `should`, `must`, and `must_not` clauses.']],
  ['Qdrant 分布式部署支持哪些扩缩容能力？','集合调整大小会停机吗，如何横向扩展？','分片和复制横向扩展，集合更新与调整大小零停机。',['Scale horizontally with sharding and replication, and update or resize collections with zero downtime.']],
  ['给 Qdrant 提交 PR 应基于和目标到哪个分支？','我往 master 提 PR 可以吗，正确分支是哪一个？','从 dev 建分支并向 dev 提 PR；master 目标将要求修改。',['Our development branch is `dev`, not `master`. Please fork the repo, branch from `dev`, and open your pull request against `dev`. PRs targeting `master` will be asked to retarget.']],
 ],
 'flink': [
  ['Flink 的运行时同时支持什么数据处理模式？','它只能做实时流吗，批处理能做吗？','streaming-first，支持批处理和流处理。',['* A streaming-first runtime that supports both batch processing and data streaming programs']],
  ['Flink DataStream API 怎样处理事件时间和乱序？','数据到达顺序乱了，README 提到什么支持？','基于 Dataflow Model 支持 event time 与 out-of-order。',['* Support for *event time* and *out-of-order* processing in the DataStream API, based on the *Dataflow Model*']],
  ['Flink 窗口和时间语义有哪些形式？','按时间、条数或会话分窗口都支持吗？','时间、计数、会话、自定义触发器；event time、processing time。',['* Flexible windowing (time, count, sessions, custom triggers) across different time semantics (event time, processing time)']],
  ['Flink 提供什么处理容错语义？','发生故障以后，README 声明什么处理保证？','exactly-once processing guarantees。',['* Fault-tolerance with *exactly-once* processing guarantees']],
  ['构建 Flink 的完整工具前提有哪些？','在 Windows 或 Linux 编译，需要哪些工具版本？','Unix-like 如 Linux/Mac/Cygwin/WSL，Git，Maven 3.9.16，Java 11/17/21。',['* Unix-like environment (we use Linux, Mac OS X, Cygwin, WSL)\n* Git\n* Maven (we require version 3.9.16)\n* Java (version 11, 17, or 21)']],
  ['Java 11 构建 Flink 的命令是什么？','装的是 JDK11，需要指定什么 profile？','./mvnw clean package -DskipTests -Djdk11 -Pjava11-target。',['./mvnw clean package -DskipTests -Djdk11 -Pjava11-target']],
  ['默认 Java 17 如何构建 Flink？','用 JDK17 编译，README 那条完整命令怎么写？','./mvnw clean package -DskipTests -Djdk17 -Pjava17-target。',['**For Java 17 (Default)**','./mvnw clean package -DskipTests -Djdk17 -Pjava17-target']],
  ['Java 21 如何构建 Flink？','使用 JDK21 时应设置哪些参数？','./mvnw clean package -DskipTests -Djdk21 -Pjava21-target。',['./mvnw clean package -DskipTests -Djdk21 -Pjava21-target']],
  ['Flink 构建命令为何使用 wrapper 和 skipTests？','mvnw 与 -DskipTests 分别起什么作用？','wrapper 保证正确 Maven 版本；skipTests 跳过测试加速。',['* The build command uses Maven wrapper (mvnw) which ensures the correct Maven version is used','* The -DskipTests flag skips running tests to speed up the build process']],
  ['Flink 编译后放在哪里，JAVA_HOME 要指向什么？','编完去哪里找产物，JDK 环境变量有何要求？','build-target；JAVA_HOME 指向正确 JDK 版本。',['Flink will be installed in `build-target`.','* Make sure your JAVA_HOME environment variable points to the correct JDK version']],
  ['Flink 是否推荐 Eclipse Scala IDE？','用旧版 Eclipse Scala 插件开发是否有兼容风险？','旧 Eclipse 和打包 Scala 版本存在问题，推荐 IntelliJ。',['**NOTE:** From our experience, this setup does not work with Flink\ndue to deficiencies of the old Eclipse version bundled with Scala IDE 3.0.3 or\ndue to version incompatibilities with the bundled Scala version in Scala IDE 4.4.1.','**We recommend to use IntelliJ instead (see above)**']],
  ['多数 Flink connector 代码还在主仓库中吗？','想改 Kafka/JDBC 连接器，应该找主仓库还是独立仓库？','多数连接器外置到 Apache 的独立仓库，如 flink-connector-kafka/jdbc。',['Most Flink connectors have been externalized to individual repos under the [Apache Software Foundation](https://github.com/apache):','* [flink-connector-jdbc](https://github.com/apache/flink-connector-jdbc)','* [flink-connector-kafka](https://github.com/apache/flink-connector-kafka)']],
 ],
 'temporal': [
  ['Temporal server 执行什么逻辑单元，怎样面对间歇故障？','任务执行中偶尔失败，它有什么自动处理？','以 Workflows 执行应用逻辑，处理间歇故障并重试失败操作。',['The Temporal server executes units of application logic called Workflows in a resilient manner that automatically handles intermittent failures, and retries failed operations.']],
  ['Temporal 项目起源于什么，由谁开发？','它与 Uber Cadence 有什么关系？','源自 Uber Cadence 的 fork，由 Cadence 创作者的 Temporal Technologies 开发。',["Temporal is a mature technology that originated as a fork of Uber's Cadence.",'It is developed by [Temporal Technologies](https://temporal.io/), a startup by the creators of Cadence.']],
  ['README 的本地安装和启动命令是什么？','第一次在本机起开发服务器，两条命令是什么？','brew install temporal，然后 temporal server start-dev。',['brew install temporal\ntemporal server start-dev']],
  ['更多 Temporal 安装方式在哪查看？','不是用 brew 安装，可以到哪里找其他方案？','Temporal CLI installation 文档入口。',['Refer to [Temporal CLI](https://docs.temporal.io/cli/#installation) documentation for more installation options.']],
  ['Temporal 示例有哪些语言，运行时配合哪个服务器？','Go 和 Java 的例子去哪拿，用远端还是本地服务器跑？','samples-go、samples-java，配合本地 Temporal server。',['Clone or download samples for [Go](https://github.com/temporalio/samples-go) or [Java](https://github.com/temporalio/samples-java) and run them with the local Temporal server.']],
  ['Go 和 Java 的 Temporal 示例集合相同吗？','两个语言的教程是不是一一相同？','目前不同，包含 HelloWorld 和较高级场景。',['We have a number of [HelloWorld type scenarios](https://github.com/temporalio/samples-java#helloworld) available, as well as more advanced ones. Note that the sets of samples are currently different between Go and Java.']],
  ['Temporal CLI 怎样列出 namespace？','命名空间有哪些，命令行怎么查？','temporal operator namespace list。',['temporal operator namespace list']],
  ['Temporal CLI 怎样列出 workflow？','已经运行的工作流，命令行怎么查看列表？','temporal workflow list。',['temporal workflow list']],
  ['Temporal Web UI 的本地地址和用途是什么？','在哪里用浏览器看示例工作流执行？','http://localhost:8233，查看执行中的 sample workflows。',['Try [Temporal Web UI](https://docs.temporal.io/web-ui) by opening [http://localhost:8233](http://localhost:8233) for viewing your sample workflows executing on Temporal.']],
  ['这个 Temporal 仓库是否就是业务 Workers 的实现仓库？','想写自己的 Workflow、Activity、Worker，README 怎样区分？','此仓库是 Temporal server 源码，业务实现使用受支持语言。',['This repository contains the source code of the Temporal server. To implement Workflows, Activities and Workers, use one of the [supported languages](https://docs.temporal.io/dev-guide/).']],
  ['Temporal 本地源码构建与测试实践分别去哪查？','从源码开发和跑测试的资料入口在哪？','CONTRIBUTING.md，docs/development/testing.md。',['- [learn how to build and run the Temporal Server locally](./CONTRIBUTING.md)','- [learn about Temporal Server testing tools and best practices](./docs/development/testing.md)']],
  ['Temporal 的新功能提案和架构资料入口分别是什么？','想了解架构并提设计方案，该查看哪些链接？','temporalio/proposals 与 docs/architecture/README.md。',['- [work on or propose a new feature](https://github.com/temporalio/proposals)','- [learn about the Temporal Server architecture](./docs/architecture/README.md)']],
 ],
 'kubernetes': [
  ['Kubernetes 管理什么，覆盖单机还是多主机？','好几台机器上的容器应用能用这个项目管理吗？','跨多个主机管理容器化应用，提供部署、维护和扩缩容机制。',['Kubernetes, also known as K8s, is an open source system for managing [containerized applications]\nacross multiple hosts. It provides basic mechanisms for the deployment, maintenance,\nand scaling of applications.']],
  ['Kubernetes 借鉴了 Google 的哪个系统？','它的生产集群经验来自哪里？','借鉴 Google 使用 Borg 运行大规模生产负载的经验和社区实践。',['Kubernetes builds upon a decade and a half of experience at Google running\nproduction workloads at scale using a system called [Borg],\ncombined with best-of-breed ideas and practices from the community.']],
  ['Kubernetes 由哪个基金会托管？','这个项目归哪个云原生基金会托管？','Cloud Native Computing Foundation，CNCF。',['Kubernetes is hosted by the Cloud Native Computing Foundation ([CNCF]).']],
  ['能把 k8s.io/kubernetes 模块直接当作第三方库使用吗？','我想直接 import Kubernetes 主仓库里的包，这受到支持吗？','不支持把该模块及其子包当库使用；应查看已发布组件列表。',['To use Kubernetes code as a library in other applications, see the [list of published components](https://git.k8s.io/kubernetes/staging/README.md).\nUse of the `k8s.io/kubernetes` module or `k8s.io/kubernetes/...` packages as libraries is not supported.']],
  ['具备 Go 环境时如何从源码构建 Kubernetes？','我已经装好 Go，拉代码以后要执行什么？','有可用 Go 环境后 clone、进入 kubernetes、运行 make。',['##### You have a working [Go environment].','git clone https://github.com/kubernetes/kubernetes\ncd kubernetes\nmake\n']],
  ['具备 Docker 环境时如何构建 Kubernetes？','只有可用的 Docker 环境，该怎么构建？','clone、进入 kubernetes，执行 make quick-release。',['##### You have a working [Docker environment].','git clone https://github.com/kubernetes/kubernetes\ncd kubernetes\nmake quick-release']],
  ['源码构建和贡献流程的入口在哪个仓库？','想找编译和提交代码的说明，README 指向哪里？','community repository，集中提供构建、贡献和联系人信息。',['The [community repository] hosts all information about\nbuilding Kubernetes from source, how to contribute code\nand documentation, who to contact about what, etc.']],
  ['遇到 Kubernetes 使用问题应先查什么？','服务出问题了，README 建议先从哪份资料排查？','从 troubleshooting guide 开始，按指南流程排查。',['If you need support, start with the [troubleshooting guide],\nand work your way through the process that we\'ve outlined.']],
  ['在哪里集中查看 Kubernetes 社区会议？','我想参加社区会议，要去哪里看安排？','Kubernetes 社区 Calendar。',['The [Calendar](https://www.kubernetes.dev/resources/calendar/) has the list of all the meetings in the Kubernetes community in a single location.']],
  ['实际采用 Kubernetes 的案例在哪查看？','想看看别的组织怎么迁移和部署它，README 有入口吗？','User Case Studies 网站展示真实部署、迁移案例。',['The [User Case Studies](https://kubernetes.io/case-studies/) website has real-world use cases of organizations across industries that are deploying/migrating to Kubernetes.']],
  ['哪个委员会监督 Kubernetes 的治理？','项目治理由谁监督，相关仓库是什么？','Kubernetes Steering Committee，参考 steering 仓库。',['The [Kubernetes Steering community repo](https://github.com/kubernetes/steering) is used by the Kubernetes Steering Committee, which oversees governance of the Kubernetes project.']],
  ['Kubernetes 发布、功能跟踪和待办信息在哪里？','想追踪新功能和版本路线，应查看哪个仓库？','Kubernetes Enhancements 仓库。',['The [Kubernetes Enhancements repo](https://github.com/kubernetes/enhancements) provides information about Kubernetes releases, as well as feature tracking and backlogs.']],
 ],
 'etcd': [
  ['main 分支能视为稳定版吗？','线上部署能直接把主分支当稳定版本吗？','main 开发期间可能不稳定甚至损坏，稳定版应查看 releases。',['**Note**: The `main` branch may be in an *unstable or even broken state* during development. For stable versions, see [releases][github-release].']],
  ['etcd 的用户 API 使用什么协议？','客户端和它交互，README 说用哪种 RPC 接口？','用户 API 使用 gRPC。',['* *Simple*: well-defined, user-facing API (gRPC)']],
  ['etcd 的 TLS 和客户端认证能力如何？','通信加密能配客户端证书认证吗？','自动 TLS，可选客户端证书认证。',['* *Secure*: automatic TLS with optional client cert authentication']],
  ['etcd 使用什么语言和一致性算法？','它用什么写的，又怎样维护高可用复制日志？','Go 编写，Raft 管理高可用复制日志。',['etcd is written in Go and uses the [Raft][] consensus algorithm to manage a highly-available replicated log.']],
  ['预编译 etcd 支持哪些平台，从哪里获取？','不想自己编译，Windows 和 Linux 能下载现成程序吗？','release page 提供 OSX、Linux、Windows、Docker 预编译发行。',['The easiest way to get etcd is to use one of the pre-built release binaries which are available for OSX, Linux, Windows, and Docker on the [release page][github-release].']],
  ['发行二进制移动到系统路径后怎样启动？','已经下载程序，怎样以后直接敲 etcd 启动？','移到 /usr/local/bin/ 后执行 etcd。',['mv /tmp/etcd-download-test/etcd /usr/local/bin/\netcd']],
  ['etcd 客户端和节点通信端口分别是什么？','2379 和 2380 哪个给客户端，哪个给节点用？','2379 客户端，2380 peer 节点通信。',['The [official etcd ports][iana-ports] are 2379 for client requests, and 2380 for peer communication.']],
  ['怎样用 etcdctl 写入并读取 mykey？','想先存一句话再拿出来，有什么命令示例？','etcdctl put mykey "this is awesome"，然后 etcdctl get mykey。',['etcdctl put mykey "this is awesome"\netcdctl get mykey']],
  ['启动本地示例集群需要先装什么，运行什么命令？','想在本机拉起几个节点，先准备哪个工具？','先装 goreman，再 goreman start，使用 Procfile 示例。',['First install [goreman](https://github.com/mattn/goreman), which manages Procfile-based applications.','goreman start']],
  ['本地示例集群有几个成员，代理是否必需？','这个本地演示会启动哪些节点，grpc-proxy 必须开吗？','三个成员 infra1、infra2、infra3，grpc-proxy 可选。',['This will bring up 3 etcd members `infra1`, `infra2` and `infra3` and optionally etcd `grpc-proxy`, which runs locally and composes a cluster.']],
  ['Go 程序怎样安装 etcd v3 客户端？','我的 Go 项目要连它，应该 go get 哪个包？','go get go.etcd.io/etcd/client/v3。',['go get go.etcd.io/etcd/client/v3']],
  ['提交 etcd bug 前应检查什么资料？','准备提 issue，README 要求先确认什么？','先检查 FAQ 是否已覆盖问题，再参考 reporting bugs 指南。',['See [reporting bugs](https://github.com/etcd-io/etcd/blob/main/Documentation/contributor-guide/reporting_bugs.md) for details about reporting any issues. Before opening an issue please check it is not covered in our [frequently asked questions].']],
 ],
 'spark': [
  ['Spark 提供哪些语言的高层 API，哪个已弃用？','会 Python、Java 或 R 能用它吗，R 有什么状态说明？','Scala、Java、Python、R；R 标为 Deprecated。',['high-level APIs in Scala, Java, Python, and R (Deprecated)']],
  ['Spark 的 SQL、机器学习和流处理工具分别是什么？','做表查询、训练算法、持续处理数据，各用哪个模块？','Spark SQL，MLlib，Structured Streaming。',['rich set of higher-level tools including Spark SQL for SQL and DataFrames,\npandas API on Spark for pandas workloads, MLlib for machine learning, GraphX for graph processing,\nand Structured Streaming for stream processing.']],
  ['如何通过 Maven 构建 Spark，预编译包还要构建吗？','下了现成包还需要再编译吗，源码构建命令是什么？','./build/mvn -DskipTests clean package；预编译包不需要此步骤。',['./build/mvn -DskipTests clean package','(You do not need to do this if you downloaded a pre-built package.)']],
  ['如何启动 Spark 的 Scala 交互环境？','想直接进入 Scala 命令行试一下，敲什么？','./bin/spark-shell。',['./bin/spark-shell']],
  ['如何启动 Spark 的 Python 交互环境？','习惯 Python，有没有现成的交互终端命令？','./bin/pyspark。',['./bin/pyspark']],
  ['Scala shell 中 range 示例的预期计数是什么？','那个十亿范围的 count 示例应该输出多少？','spark.range(1000 * 1000 * 1000).count() 返回 1,000,000,000。',['Try the following command, which should return 1,000,000,000:','scala> spark.range(1000 * 1000 * 1000).count()']],
  ['怎样在本地运行 SparkPi 示例？','想先跑一遍算圆周率的例子，启动命令是什么？','./bin/run-example SparkPi。',['\n./bin/run-example SparkPi\n','will run the Pi example locally.']],
  ['示例程序目录和通用运行形式是什么？','例子放哪，带参数启动某个例子怎么写？','examples 目录；./bin/run-example <class> [params]。',['Spark also comes with several sample programs in the `examples` directory.\nTo run one of them, use `./bin/run-example <class> [params]`.']],
  ['运行示例时 MASTER 有哪些模式？','想指定集群或本地线程数量，MASTER 可以填什么？','spark:// URL、yarn、local 单线程、local[N] N 线程。',['examples to a cluster. This can be spark:// URL,\n"yarn" to run on YARN, and "local" to run\nlocally with one thread, or "local[N]" to run locally with N threads.']],
  ['怎样把 SparkPi 示例提交到 host:7077？','不在本地跑，要交给这个 Spark 主节点，命令如何写？','MASTER=spark://host:7077 ./bin/run-example SparkPi。',['MASTER=spark://host:7077 ./bin/run-example SparkPi']],
  ['运行 Spark 测试有哪些前置步骤和命令？','想跑测试，能不构建就直接运行吗？','先 building Spark，再 ./dev/run-tests。',['Testing first requires [building Spark](#building-spark). Once Spark is built, tests\ncan be run using:','./dev/run-tests']],
  ['README 是否包含完整编程指南，应到哪里查？','这份首页能查所有开发细节吗，完整资料在哪？','README 仅基本安装说明，完整文档和编程指南在项目文档页面。',['You can find the latest Spark documentation, including a programming\nguide, on the [project web page](https://spark.apache.org/documentation.html).\nThis README file only contains basic setup instructions.']],
 ],
 'triton': [
  ['Triton 可服务哪些框架的模型？','PyTorch、ONNX 和 TensorRT 模型能交给它部署吗？','支持 TensorRT、PyTorch、ONNX、OpenVINO、Python、RAPIDS FIL 等。',['multiple deep learning and machine learning frameworks, including TensorRT,\nPyTorch, ONNX, OpenVINO, Python, RAPIDS FIL, and more.']],
  ['Triton 支持哪些硬件和部署环境？','只在 NVIDIA GPU 上能用，还是 CPU、边缘设备也支持？','云、数据中心、边缘、嵌入式；NVIDIA GPU、x86/ARM CPU、AWS Inferentia。',['Inference Server supports inference across cloud, data center, edge and embedded\ndevices on NVIDIA GPUs, x86 and ARM CPU, or AWS Inferentia.']],
  ['Triton 对有状态模型提供哪些机制？','模型需要保持状态时，有什么批处理和状态管理能力？','Sequence batching 和 implicit state management。',['- [Sequence batching](docs/user_guide/batcher.md#sequence-batcher) and\n  [implicit state management](docs/user_guide/architecture.md#implicit-state-management)\n  for stateful models']],
  ['怎样扩展 Triton 后端及前后处理？','有自定义模型和前处理，README 指向哪种扩展接口？','Backend API 可添加自定义后端和前后处理。',['- Provides [Backend API](https://github.com/triton-inference-server/backend) that\n  allows adding custom backends and pre/post processing operations']],
  ['Triton 模型流水线有哪些组织方式？','多个模型串起来，README 说支持哪两种方法？','Ensembling 或 Business Logic Scripting BLS。',['- Model pipelines using\n  [Ensembling](docs/user_guide/architecture.md#ensemble-models) or [Business\n  Logic Scripting\n  (BLS)](https://github.com/triton-inference-server/python_backend#business-logic-scripting)']],
  ['Triton 网络推理协议基于什么标准？','用 HTTP 或 gRPC 调用模型，README 提到哪个社区协议？','HTTP/REST、GRPC，基于 KServe protocol。',['- [HTTP/REST and GRPC inference\n  protocols](docs/customization_guide/inference_protocols.md) based on the community\n  developed [KServe\n  protocol](https://github.com/kserve/kserve/tree/master/docs/predict-api/v2)']],
  ['能把 Triton 直接嵌入应用进程吗？','边缘设备不想单独起服务器，有什么进程内 API？','C API 和 Java API 可直接链接进应用。',['- A [C API](docs/customization_guide/inprocess_c_api.md) and\n  [Java API](docs/customization_guide/inprocess_java_api.md)\n  allow Triton to link directly into your application for edge and other in-process use cases']],
  ['Triton 的 Metrics 可观察哪些指标？','想看显卡利用率、延迟和吞吐，README 支持吗？','GPU 利用率、服务器吞吐和延迟等。',['- [Metrics](docs/user_guide/metrics.md) indicating GPU utilization, server\n  throughput, server latency, and more']],
  ['快速示例如何准备模型仓库？','第一次跑示例，需要拉哪个分支并执行什么脚本？','clone r26.09，进入 server/docs/examples，执行 fetch_models.sh。',['git clone -b r26.09 https://github.com/triton-inference-server/server.git\ncd server/docs/examples\n./fetch_models.sh']],
  ['快速示例启动服务时挂载什么目录，加载什么模型？','那条 docker 命令把模型映射到哪里，实际加载哪个模型？','model_repository 挂 /models，模型仓库 /models，explicit 模式加载 densenet_onnx。',['docker run --gpus=1 --rm --net=host -v ${PWD}/model_repository:/models nvcr.io/nvidia/tritonserver:26.09-py3 tritonserver --model-repository=/models --model-control-mode explicit --load-model densenet_onnx']],
  ['README 推荐怎样构建和使用 Triton？','源码部署和 Docker 部署，首页推荐哪个方式？','推荐 Docker images。',['The recommended way to build and use Triton Inference Server is with Docker\nimages.']],
  ['自己的模型交给 Triton 前需要准备什么？','不是官方例子，部署模型前先放哪里，还可能要建什么配置？','模型放进 model repository；按模型类型和能力需要可能建立 model configuration。',['The first step in using Triton to serve your models is to place one or\nmore models into a [model repository](docs/user_guide/model_repository.md). Depending on\nthe type of the model and on what Triton capabilities you want to enable for\nthe model, you may need to create a [model\nconfiguration](docs/user_guide/model_configuration.md) for the model.']],
 ],
 'vllm': [
  ['vLLM 的主要用途是什么？','这个项目是训练模型还是提供大模型推理服务？','快速易用的 LLM inference and serving 库。',['vLLM is a fast and easy-to-use library for LLM inference and serving.']],
  ['vLLM 怎样管理 attention 的 key/value 内存？','KV cache 用什么机制提高内存管理效率？','PagedAttention。',['- Efficient management of attention key and value memory with [**PagedAttention**](https://blog.vllm.ai/2023/06/20/vllm.html)']],
  ['vLLM 支持哪些请求批处理和缓存能力？','不断进来的请求可以持续拼批，能缓存相同前缀吗？','Continuous batching、chunked prefill、prefix caching。',['- Continuous batching of incoming requests, chunked prefill, prefix caching']],
  ['vLLM 支持哪些分布式并行形式？','模型太大想分机器推理，可以按哪些维度并行？','Tensor、pipeline、data、expert、context parallelism。',['- Tensor, pipeline, data, expert, and context parallelism for distributed inference']],
  ['vLLM 结构化输出使用哪些库？','希望生成 JSON 等受约束结果，README 提到什么实现？','xgrammar 或 guidance。',['- Generation of structured outputs using xgrammar or guidance']],
  ['vLLM 服务接口兼容哪些 API 协议？','现有 OpenAI 客户端能连吗，另外还支持什么协议？','OpenAI-compatible API、Anthropic Messages API、gRPC。',['- OpenAI-compatible API server, plus Anthropic Messages API and gRPC support']],
  ['vLLM 支持哪些 CPU 架构和主要 GPU？','没有 NVIDIA 卡，AMD、Intel 或 ARM 机器是否列为支持？','NVIDIA、AMD、Intel GPU；x86/ARM/PowerPC CPU，另有硬件插件。',['- Support for NVIDIA GPUs, AMD GPUs, Intel GPUs, and x86/ARM/PowerPC CPUs.']],
  ['vLLM multi-LoRA 支持哪些层？','想同时服务多套 LoRA，MoE 层也支持吗？','dense 和 MoE layers 的 efficient multi-LoRA。',['- Efficient multi-LoRA support for dense and MoE layers']],
  ['vLLM 是否支持检索嵌入模型，有哪些例子？','不生成文本，只做向量检索的模型能跑吗？','支持 E5-Mistral、GTE、ColBERT 等 embedding and retrieval models。',['- Embedding and retrieval models (e.g., E5-Mistral, GTE, ColBERT)']],
  ['安装 vLLM 推荐哪种工具，命令是什么？','第一次安装，README 推荐 uv 还是 pip，具体怎么敲？','推荐 uv，也可 pip；uv pip install vllm。',['Install vLLM with [`uv`](https://docs.astral.sh/uv/) (recommended) or `pip`:','uv pip install vllm']],
  ['vLLM 的技术问题与用户交流分别在哪里？','遇到 bug 要去哪提，想和其他使用者讨论去哪里？','技术问题和功能请求用 GitHub Issues，用户交流用 vLLM Forum。',['- For technical questions and feature requests, please use GitHub [Issues](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/issues)','- For discussing with fellow users, please use the [vLLM Forum](https://discuss.vllm.ai)']],
  ['vLLM 安全漏洞应通过哪个入口报告？','发现安全问题，README 指定哪个通道？','GitHub Security Advisories。',['- For security disclosures, please use GitHub\'s [Security Advisories](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/security/advisories) feature']],
 ],
 'clickhouse': [
  ['ClickHouse 是什么类型的数据库，主要面向什么任务？','它按行还是按列存，适合做什么报表？','开源列式 DBMS，用于实时分析报表。',['ClickHouse® is an open-source column-oriented database management system that allows generating analytical data reports in real-time.']],
  ['README 安装指引列出了哪些操作系统？','首页那条安装命令适用于哪些系统？','Linux、macOS、FreeBSD。',['## How To Install (Linux, macOS, FreeBSD)']],
  ['README 展示的 ClickHouse 安装命令是什么？','本机安装的那条命令怎么写？','curl https://clickhouse.com/ | sh；仅为原文命令，不在测试中执行。',['curl https://clickhouse.com/ | sh']],
  ['不安装本地 ClickHouse 能怎样试用？','只想先试着查点数据，能用什么托管入口？','可免费试用 ClickHouse Cloud。',['Or skip the install: try [ClickHouse Cloud](https://console.clickhouse.cloud/signUp?utm_medium=referral&utm_source=github) for free and start querying in minutes.']],
  ['小型 ClickHouse 集群的搭建查询教程入口在哪？','想从小集群跑通查询，首页指向哪份教程？','Tutorial 链接，说明搭建和查询 small ClickHouse cluster。',['* [Tutorial](https://clickhouse.com/docs/getting_started/tutorial/) shows how to set up and query a small ClickHouse cluster.']],
  ['深入文档和产品概览分别在哪查看？','想先了解整体再读细节，应点首页的哪些入口？','Official website 看概览，Documentation 看深入资料。',['* [Official website](https://clickhouse.com/) has a quick high-level overview of ClickHouse on the main page.','* [Documentation](https://clickhouse.com/docs/) provides more in-depth information.']],
  ['ClickHouse 用户实时交流渠道有哪些？','我想找其他用户聊使用问题，README 提到哪里？','Slack 和 Telegram。',['* [Slack](https://clickhouse.com/slack) and [Telegram](https://telegram.me/clickhouse_en) allow chatting with ClickHouse users in real-time.']],
  ['ClickHouse 博客提供哪类内容？','想看技术文章、公告和活动回顾，哪个入口合适？','Blog 有相关文章、公告与活动报告。',['* [Blog](https://clickhouse.com/blog/) contains various ClickHouse-related articles, as well as announcements and reports about events.']],
  ['如何在浏览器中带语法高亮查看 ClickHouse 源码？','不 clone 仓库，首页有在线代码浏览器吗？','github.dev Code Browser。',['* [Code Browser (github.dev)](https://github.dev/ClickHouse/ClickHouse) with syntax highlighting, powered by github.dev.']],
  ['怎样与 ClickHouse 专家讨论自己的用例？','想请项目专家看看我的业务场景，README 提供什么入口？','Contact us 链接用于讨论 use case。',['* [Contact us](https://clickhouse.com/company/contact) to discuss your use case with a ClickHouse expert.']],
  ['在哪里集中查看 ClickHouse 发布演示与视频？','错过发布讲解了，去哪补录像和演示？','ClickHouse Theater 和 YouTube Playlist。',['Watch all release presentations and videos at [ClickHouse Theater](https://presentations.clickhouse.com/) and [YouTube Playlist](https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PL0Z2YDlm0b3jAlSy1JxyP8zluvXaN3nxU).']],
  ['想申请在 ClickHouse 活动分享，可以通过哪里？','有个主题想去 meetup 演讲，README 有没有报名入口？','Upcoming Events 的 speaking apply 表单。',['Want to speak? Apply [here](https://forms.gle/3h4XCEENJZ3eaVGy7)']],
 ],
}

